{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日前ですか\n仙台公演終わりましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は福岡だから\n焦って書いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/17/1925027/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリはまだ内緒なので\n福岡終わるまで待ってね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ざっくりレポいきまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1公演目に\n公演中にぺろぺろを46回言うって宣言しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん達成できました！たぶん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなちゃんと数えてた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台の飯ぺろは\n萩の月とか喜久福とかいっぱいあるんだけども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はこれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/17/1925027/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん人生初ずんだシェイク！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな美味しい美味しい言うから\n飲んでみたい！ってずっと思ってたけど\nその期待以上に美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/17/1925027/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブで来たせいか\nなんかマイホームな気分で\nライブしちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/17/1925027/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった！！来てくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/17/1925027/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の福岡も\